        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9009, Clean and Contemporary Infinity Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia made 9009 Infinity Cabinet Door Pull is forged from solid brass. The unique design adds a modern twist for contemporary homes. Available in your choice of oil-rubbed bronze, polished chrome, and satin nickel finishes in 6 lengths ranging from 4\" up  to 18\".\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSince this simple cabinet pull is so easy to clean it will maintain a smooth, rich luster for the lifetime of your home; and just like all Omnia's brass cabinet pulls, the 9009 will prove worthy of the exceptional standards that Omnia has sustained for more than 40 years.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/infinity-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9009p-415\"><b>Matching Infinity Refrigerator Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9009/70:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 2-3/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9009/118:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4-5/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9009/170:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6-5/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9009/220:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8-5/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9009/273:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10-3/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9009/420:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 16-1/2\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
